==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*7 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Madam Peng]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**4 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5.33~12 seconds<sup>160f~360f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Seeing as this stage consists of purely [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark enemies]], using a bunch of [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Darks]] like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] can easily destroy all of them in a matter of seconds. Otherwise, use Area Attackers or strong Single Attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to repeatedly knock back these high-KB enemies.

